  "title": "SMB: Eliminate Response<unknown> errors (GNS365)",
  "description": "When there were multiple responses to a Find-First2 command,\nthe 2nd thru n responses had \"Response<unknown>\" errors.\nThis has been corrected by postponing the removal of the\ntransaction from the unmatched table until the packet is fully\ndissected.",
